-16.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">سلسله‌مراتب قابلیت باند (Hierarchy of Bondability - HOB)</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-17.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">سیل فوری عاج (Immediate Dentin Sealing - IDS) و رزین کوتینگ (Resin Coating - RC)</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/dentai/dentai-18.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\"/> <path d=\"M12 8V4\"/> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M9 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M15 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">لایه مهار شده با اکسیژن (Oxygen-Inhibited Layer - OIL)</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> دنت‌AI</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"dentai\">\n        <a href=\"/de